ThinkPipe AI - Official Corporate Website Design Spec

1. Project Objective
  To build a high-performance, responsive corporate portal that establishes ThinkPipe AI's brand identity, showcases core technology services, and provides a secure gateway for client interaction.

2. Core Functional Modules
A. Brand Identity & Introduction
  Hero Section: A minimalist, tech-forward landing area with the company's value proposition.
  About Us: Narrative on ThinkPipe's mission to bridge AI and backend scalability.
  Tech Stack Showcase: A visual grid of the underlying technologies.

B. Business & Service Showcase
  Service Cards: Interactive components for:
  Intelligent Data Pipelines
  Custom Enterprise API Solutions
  AI-Driven Business Automation
  Case Studies / Demo: A placeholder for future project walkthroughs or live API demos.

C. Client Gateway (Authentication)
  User Authentication: Secure Login/Sign-up interface.
  Client Dashboard: A private area for clients to view project status, API keys, or service usage metrics.

D. Lead Generation (Contact Us)
  Dynamic Contact Form: A validated form for inquiries, integrated with a backend mailer service.
  Interactive Map / Office Info: Location details and social media links.

3. Technical Architecture
  Frontend: React.js (Vite) + Tailwind CSS (Responsive Design).
  State Management: React Context API or Redux for user session handling.
  Routing: React Router for seamless Single Page Application (SPA) navigation.
  Hosting: Vercel or AWS Amplify for automated CI/CD deployment.

4. Development Phases
  Phase 1: Static Branding. UI/UX implementation of the Landing and About pages.
  Phase 2: Auth & State. Implementing the Login flow and session persistence.
  Phase 3: Interactive Portal. Developing the Dashboard and dynamic Contact modules.
